  "route_rules":["Transport routes never calculate authoritative percentage, duration or cohort results from client data and never accept discarded Product as classification input.","Reusable Product Line identity carries no global SLA authority; every classification/SLA calculation resolves the Service Request Customer and a Customer-compatible Contract Product Line before authoritative use.","Policy revision affects applicable existing classified Service Requests on subsequent pure reads through the current CPL policy pointer; prior policy/classification evidence remains history rather than being rewritten.","Objective scheduling timezone has no SLA/cohort/report-period authority; canonical monthly SLA cohort chronology remains America/Guayaquil.","Report generation reads one stable accepted-state Snapshot; artifact generation never queries mutable live domain tables and completed report evidence cannot authorize operational cleanup."]
